  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37143964",
      "title": "Making any Widget Tappable with InkWell",
      "lectureOrder": 159,
      "videoOrder": 147,
      "sourceHash": "78d938205f463a931bd480dc2e8c63d36c009bc3540b9862505b458f67435631",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.18,
          "en": "So Let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.18,
          "end": 6.03,
          "en": "that these grid items are tappable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.03,
          "end": 9.93,
          "en": "And for that I'm going back to my category",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.93,
          "end": 14.93,
          "en": "grid item dart file and in there we can make this container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.09,
          "end": 19.86,
          "en": "or any other widget tappable by wrapping this widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.86,
          "end": 22.45,
          "en": "that should be tappable with another widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 26.853,
          "en": "and that other widget would be the InkWell widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.72,
          "end": 30.3,
          "en": "Now actually, the InkWell widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.3,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "is not just about making some child widget tappable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "that could be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 38.193,
          "en": "with the GestureDetector widget as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.03,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "If you wrap a widget like this container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 45.21,
          "en": "with GestureDetector, you can add a broad variety",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.21,
          "end": 46.71,
          "en": "of listeners to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.71,
          "end": 50.19,
          "en": "For example, onTap but also may other listeners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.19,
          "end": 52.83,
          "en": "to listen all kinds of user interactions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 54.243,
          "en": "with the child widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.563,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "But if you use InkWell instead, you can also add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 64.11,
          "en": "an onTap or many other listeners as you can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.11,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "but in addition you get a nice visual feedback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.44,
          "end": 70.02,
          "en": "if a user taps the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.02,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "With GestureDetector you would get no feedback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 77.613,
          "en": "with InkWell you do, that's why I'm using InkWell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.75,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "With InkWell wrapped around container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 85.41,
          "en": "I can add the onTap parameter to set up a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.41,
          "end": 88.533,
          "en": "that will be triggered whenever this item will be tapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "So with that, we already would be able to listen to events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 95.13,
          "en": "but I'm not done yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.13,
          "end": 98.61,
          "en": "In addition, I'll set a splash color which will be important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 102.033,
          "en": "for this visual tapping effect that we get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.28999999999999,
          "end": 107.19,
          "en": "And I'll set this to theme.of(context).primaryColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.19,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "to use one of my theme colors for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 112.923,
          "en": "or as a basis for this effect to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.78,
          "end": 117.96000000000001,
          "en": "And we can also set a BorderRadius here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.96000000000001,
          "end": 121.44,
          "en": "which does not want a number, but instead a BorderRadius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.44,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "object which can be constructed in different ways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.21,
          "end": 129.33,
          "en": "For example, by using the circular constructor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.33,
          "end": 132.54,
          "en": "which allows us to define a radius like 16",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.54,
          "end": 135.72,
          "en": "to give these items some nice rounded corners.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.72,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "You can try out different values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 140.073,
          "en": "to get exactly the look you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 142.32,
          "end": 145.02,
          "en": "So with that these items should be tappable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.02,
          "end": 147.48,
          "en": "Right now nothing happens when we tap them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.48,
          "end": 149.57999999999998,
          "en": "but they are tappable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.57999999999998,
          "end": 152.57999999999998,
          "en": "And if we saved this all and force a reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.57999999999998,
          "end": 155.76,
          "en": "we can see this effect in a very subtle way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.76,
          "end": 157.98,
          "en": "if you tap and hold one of these items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 160.53,
          "en": "you see they light up a little bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 160.53,
          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "but of course we don't have the rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 165.09,
          "en": "or at least we don't have the rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 166.77,
          "en": "on these items right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.77,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "If we tap one and hold this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 172.65,
          "en": "the highlighted fact indeed has rounded corners.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.65,
          "end": 175.29,
          "en": "So the missing thing here indeed only is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.29,
          "end": 178.92000000000002,
          "en": "to go to this container in our category grid item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.92000000000002,
          "end": 182.76,
          "en": "and there in decoration, besides adding this gradient,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 182.76,
          "end": 185.34,
          "en": "I also wanna add a BorderRadius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.34,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "and just as on the InkWell this BorderRadius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 194.78,
          "en": "should be set to BorderRadius circular 16, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.74,
          "end": 200.37,
          "en": "And with that, now we finally get these rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.37,
          "end": 204.06,
          "en": "and this nice highlight effect if we tap and hold.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 205.92000000000002,
          "en": "Of course, the next goal is to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.92000000000002,
          "end": 208.07999999999998,
          "en": "that we cannot just tap and hold,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.07999999999998,
          "end": 211.11,
          "en": "but that we actually navigate to a different screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.11,
          "end": 212.793,
          "en": "if we tap one of these items.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
